{"id": "a8d36635-60c1-469d-9ccd-2b86f74b9c99", "slug": "three-ways-to-make-an-impact", "title": "Three ways to make an impact", "description": "Three Ways Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Three ways to make an impact\"\ndescription: \"Three Ways Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A9C8FF\"\n  secondary: \"#131313\"\n  accent: \"#FF5C35\"\n  background: \"#F2EFE7\"\n  surface: \"#77736B\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#77736B\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"30px\"\n  control: \"30px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Three ways to make an impact\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 49; favorites: 3; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nThree Ways Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nWhat we explore Three ways to make an impact. Select a card to explore 01 / DIRECTION + Direction Start with clarity. We uncover the central idea and transform uncertainty into a focused creative direction. Discover str…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Three ways to make an impact.; Start with clarity.; Design the feeling.; Build recognition..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A9C8FF, secondary #131313, accent #FF5C35, background #F2EFE7, surface #77736B, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Three ways to make an impact</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen grid place-items-center p-4 md:p-8 overflow-x-hidden bg-[#f2efe7] text-[#131313] font-sans antialiased selection:bg-[#131313] selection:text-white\">\n\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1180px]\">\n        <header class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end gap-6 mb-8\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\">What we explore</div>\n                <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"max-w-[650px] text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-medium leading-[0.88] tracking-tight\">\n                    Three ways to make an impact.\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"pb-1 text-sm text-[#77736b]\">Select a card to explore</p>\n        </header>\n\n        <section class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 w-full\" style=\"min-height: 480px;\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Direction -->\n            <article class=\"expandable-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] p-6 cursor-pointer isolate flex-shrink-0\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(#ff5c35, #ff5c35) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.15)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: all 700ms cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.2,1);\">\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap\">01 / DIRECTION</span>\n                    <span class=\"plus-icon w-10 h-10 flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-current rounded-full text-xl transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">+</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"vertical-title absolute bottom-6 left-6 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 md:-rotate-90 text-2xl tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-250 ease-out\">\n                    Direction\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-visual absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.86);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[74px] right-[25px] md:right-[45px] w-[180px] h-[180px] md:w-[220px] md:h-[220px] border-2 border-black rounded-full\" style=\"transform-origin: top right;\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[20px] md:inset-[28px] border border-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[50px] md:inset-[65px] bg-[#ffe66c] rounded-full\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"orbit-dot absolute top-[20px] left-[20px] md:top-[25px] md:left-[25px] w-[20px] h-[20px] md:w-[25px] md:h-[25px] bg-black rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-content absolute z-10 bottom-7 left-7 right-7 max-w-[390px] transition-all duration-550 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium leading-[0.9] tracking-tight\">Start with clarity.</h2>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[330px] text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70\">We uncover the central idea and transform uncertainty into a focused creative direction.</p>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block mt-5 px-4 py-2 border border-current rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-black hover:text-[#ff5c35]\">Discover strategy</span>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Experience -->\n            <article class=\"expandable-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] p-6 cursor-pointer isolate flex-shrink-0 text-white\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(#131313, #131313) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), rgba(0,0,0,0.5)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: all 700ms cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.2,1);\">\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap\">02 / EXPERIENCE</span>\n                    <span class=\"plus-icon w-10 h-10 flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-current rounded-full text-xl transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">+</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"vertical-title absolute bottom-6 left-6 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 md:-rotate-90 text-2xl tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-250 ease-out\">\n                    Experience\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-visual absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.86);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[90px] right-[25px] md:right-[45px] w-[180px] h-[140px] md:w-[230px] md:h-[180px] border border-white/40\" style=\"border-radius: 90px 90px 20px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 48%, rgba(255,255,255,.3) 49%, transparent 51%); transform-origin: top right;\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[14px] md:inset-[18px] border border-white/20\" style=\"border-radius: inherit;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"floating-ball absolute top-[115px] right-[90px] md:right-[120px] w-[56px] h-[56px] md:w-[72px] md:h-[72px] bg-[#a9c8ff] rounded-full\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(169,200,255,.3);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-content absolute z-10 bottom-7 left-7 right-7 max-w-[390px] transition-all duration-550 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium leading-[0.9] tracking-tight\">Design the feeling.</h2>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[330px] text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70\">Every interaction is shaped to feel intuitive, responsive, and unmistakably human.</p>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block mt-5 px-4 py-2 border border-current rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-white hover:text-[#131313]\">Explore experience</span>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Identity -->\n            <article class=\"expandable-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-[30px] p-6 cursor-pointer isolate flex-shrink-0\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(#a9c8ff, #a9c8ff) padding-box, linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.1)) border-box; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: all 700ms cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.2,1);\">\n\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap\">03 / IDENTITY</span>\n                    <span class=\"plus-icon w-10 h-10 flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-current rounded-full text-xl transition-transform duration-500 ease-out\">+</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"vertical-title absolute bottom-6 left-6 md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2 md:-rotate-90 text-2xl tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap transition-opacity duration-250 ease-out\">\n                    Identity\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-visual absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.86);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[80px] right-[25px] md:right-[35px] text-[120px] md:text-9xl lg:text-[230px] font-semibold leading-[0.7] tracking-tighter opacity-75\" style=\"transform: rotate(-8deg);\">Aa</div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-[200px] md:top-[230px] right-[-20px] w-[330px] py-3 overflow-hidden border-y border-black\" style=\"transform: rotate(-8deg);\">\n                        <div class=\"ticker-content whitespace-nowrap text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase\" style=\"display: flex; width: max-content;\">\n                            <span class=\"pr-2\">IDENTITY • CULTURE • CHARACTER • </span>\n                            <span class=\"pr-2\">IDENTITY • CULTURE • CHARACTER • </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card-content absolute z-10 bottom-7 left-7 right-7 max-w-[390px] transition-all duration-550 ease-[cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)]\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-3 text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-medium leading-[0.9] tracking-tight\">Build recognition.</h2>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[330px] text-sm leading-relaxed opacity-70\">A flexible identity system that stays consistent while leaving room to evolve.</p>\n                    <span class=\"inline-block mt-5 px-4 py-2 border border-current rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors hover:bg-black hover:text-[#a9c8ff]\">View identity</span>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // 1. Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            const title = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            const words = title.innerText.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n            title.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.innerText = word;\n                inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                inner.classList.add('reveal-word');\n                inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                title.appendChild(wrapper);\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('.reveal-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: title,\n                    start: \"top 85%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            // 2. Continuous Art Animations\n            // Orbit Dot\n            gsap.to('.orbit-dot', {\n                rotation: 360,\n                transformOrigin: \"center center\",\n                duration: 6,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"linear\",\n                onUpdate: function() {\n                    // GSAP handles transform origin differently across viewports, using explicit math for stability\n                    const rect = this.targets()[0].parentElement.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const radius = rect.width / 2;\n                    gsap.set(this.targets()[0], { transformOrigin: `${radius - 20}px ${radius - 20}px` });\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Floating Ball\n            gsap.to('.floating-ball', {\n                y: -20,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // Ticker\n            gsap.to('.ticker-content', {\n                xPercent: -50,\n                duration: 6,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"linear\"\n            });\n\n            // 3. Accordion Interaction Logic\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.expandable-card');\n            let activeIndex = 0;\n\n            const isMobile = () => window.innerWidth < 768;\n\n            function renderCards() {\n                const mobile = isMobile();\n\n                cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                    const isActive = index === activeIndex;\n\n                    // Layout dimensions\n                    if (mobile) {\n                        card.style.width = '100%';\n                        card.style.height = isActive ? '430px' : '100px';\n                    } else {\n                        card.style.height = '480px';\n                        card.style.width = isActive ? '70%' : '15%';\n                        card.style.minWidth = '110px';\n                    }\n\n                    // Internal states\n                    const plus = card.querySelector('.plus-icon');\n                    const vTitle = card.querySelector('.vertical-title');\n                    const visual = card.querySelector('.card-visual');\n                    const content = card.querySelector('.card-content');\n\n                    if (isActive) {\n                        plus.style.transform = 'rotate(45deg)';\n                        vTitle.style.opacity = '0';\n\n                        visual.style.opacity = '1';\n                        visual.style.transform = 'scale(1)';\n                        visual.style.transitionDelay = '180ms';\n\n                        content.style.opacity = '1';\n                        content.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n                        content.style.transitionDelay = '280ms';\n                    } else {\n                        plus.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';\n                        vTitle.style.opacity = '1';\n\n                        visual.style.opacity = '0';\n                        visual.style.transform = 'scale(0.86)';\n                        visual.style.transitionDelay = '0ms';\n\n                        content.style.opacity = '0';\n                        content.style.transform = 'translateY(20px)';\n                        content.style.transitionDelay = '0ms';\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n\n            cards.forEach((card, index) => {\n                card.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                    if (activeIndex !== index) {\n                        activeIndex = index;\n                        renderCards();\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Initial render and resize listener\n            renderCards();\n            window.addEventListener('resize', renderCards);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "three-ways-to-make-an-impact.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/three-ways-to-make-an-impact.jpg", "source_name": "three-ways-to-make-an-impact-DESIGN.md", "views": 86, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T08:27:39.074009+00:00"}